| Exact diff hygiene | `git diff --check BASE CANDIDATE` exited 0 |
| CI action references | `actions/checkout@v7` and `actions/setup-go@v7` tags both resolved upstream |

The implementation otherwise fits the repository architecture: the production
gate is headless and read-only, CI invokes it before generation/tests/vet/build,
the registry is source-pinned and fail-closed, compatibility coverage is
preserved, durable catalog mutations retain idempotency/recovery evidence, and
README/report types make no runtime availability or support claim.

No repository source file was modified during review. Reviewer mutants and
tool-readiness evidence are isolated under `.temp/TASK-260830-treeox/`.

